# All developers can work on any context.
# Architectural safety comes from:
#   1. Governor Agent (automated ADR + boundary enforcement)
#   2. CI pipeline (contract tests, architecture tests)
#   3. Human review (at least 1 approval from any developer)
#   4. Bounded contexts in code (modular monolith, no cross-context imports)
#
# Developers:
#   @TheFoundryEngine  (Bryan)  — Governor / Architect
#   @NickFlach         (Nick)   — Developer
