#   @bryanyMac         (Bryan)  — Developer
#   @TBD-Neel          (Neel)   — Developer (Team D — Design & UX)
#
# CODEOWNERS is advisory — it suggests reviewers but does not gate PRs by team.
# GitHub branch protection should require 1 review from anyone, not per-team.

